WEBVTT

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:20.896
<i>Had too much to drink again?</i>

00:00:21.605 --> 00:00:25.609
<i>Pleasure is never far from pain, Leon.</i>

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.654
I've never had alcohol before.

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.405
Seriously?

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:31.323
Yes.

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:36.495
Is this the one Neo Xiangwan
contacted us about seven days ago?

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:38.163
<i>Without a doubt.</i>

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:42.334
<i>The same one that was reported</i>
<i>swimming inland from Lake Tai.</i>

00:00:44.962 --> 00:00:48.548
I was thinking it was about time
to check it out.

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:51.468
Do you think it'll head this way?

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:53.887
The possibility is high.

00:00:54.304 --> 00:00:57.140
It's most likely
being drawn towards the reactor.

00:01:00.936 --> 00:01:01.979
Ouch.

00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:36.531
What's the situation?

00:02:36.615 --> 00:02:37.366
As we predicted.

00:02:37.449 --> 00:02:38.700
Operation Howl Breakthrough

00:02:38.784 --> 00:02:40.619
See if it can be driven off with flares.

00:02:55.509 --> 00:02:56.468
It's no good.

00:02:56.551 --> 00:02:59.471
<i>Send an attack helicopter squadron</i>
<i>to the front defensive line.</i>

00:02:59.554 --> 00:03:01.348
<i>Use of ABI rounds approved.</i>

00:03:01.556 --> 00:03:04.226
-<i>Deploy second line of defense now!</i>
-Yes, sir!

00:03:04.726 --> 00:03:07.020
Pandora, get ready to move out!

00:03:07.312 --> 00:03:10.232
-Guess I've got to earn my pay.
-<i>Rejected.</i>

00:03:11.942 --> 00:03:15.445
<i>It's been made clear</i>
<i>that the hyperdrive is of no use to us.</i>

00:03:16.363 --> 00:03:21.034
<i>"Destroy this insane world</i>
<i>and create a new one"?</i>

00:03:21.201 --> 00:03:24.704
<i>I guess you just didn't</i>
<i>have the power to do that, Leon Lau.</i>

00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:28.208
<i>With the hyperdrive unusable,</i>

00:03:28.458 --> 00:03:31.169
<i>Pandora will never be</i>
<i>a valuable military asset.</i>

00:03:31.628 --> 00:03:34.756
What happened the last time
outsiders were let in

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.383
to research the reactor?

00:03:36.967 --> 00:03:38.635
We will protect this city.

00:03:40.595 --> 00:03:42.180
Am I wrong, Princess?

00:03:42.556 --> 00:03:43.598
You are not.

00:03:46.643 --> 00:03:48.770
The usual, please, ma'am!

00:03:48.854 --> 00:03:51.189
Here you go. I threw in a little extra.

00:03:51.273 --> 00:03:52.274
Thanks!

00:03:55.444 --> 00:03:56.695
Do you know this man?

00:03:57.529 --> 00:04:00.365
I don't know.
Is he your boyfriend or something?

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:02.826
Sorry to bother you.

00:04:17.591 --> 00:04:18.842
Leon!

00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:27.058
Looks like it's not
an attack from the air.

00:04:29.811 --> 00:04:30.771
An enemy attack?

00:04:36.067 --> 00:04:37.068
I must protect...

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:39.905
I must protect Neo Xianglong!

00:04:40.322 --> 00:04:43.200
APRIL 30TH 2038, 11:08

00:04:44.409 --> 00:04:48.079
Attack helicopter squadron
deployed at first defense line.

00:04:48.497 --> 00:04:50.165
Requesting ABI round permissions.

00:04:50.373 --> 00:04:53.460
Surely it's better than letting
the outsiders attack.

00:04:53.877 --> 00:04:56.338
Permission granted! Commence bombardment!

00:04:56.713 --> 00:05:01.176
All units, attack!
Aim for the front-left of the BRAI.

00:05:01.426 --> 00:05:02.761
Fire ABI rounds!

00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:20.278
Two hundred million per round.
What a waste.

00:05:20.612 --> 00:05:22.405
They really are evolving.

00:05:22.739 --> 00:05:25.283
<i>The first line of defense</i>
<i>has been breached!</i>

00:05:26.993 --> 00:05:30.247
Accumulation rates, normal.
Interference levels, normal.

00:05:30.413 --> 00:05:32.666
Dimensional loss rate
is within margin of error.

00:05:32.874 --> 00:05:34.668
I don't see anything abnormal.

00:05:44.386 --> 00:05:46.388
Where is Mr. Scientist going?

00:05:48.098 --> 00:05:49.224
APRIL 30TH, 2038, 12:18

00:05:49.307 --> 00:05:51.309
<i>Enemy approaching second defensive line.</i>

00:05:51.643 --> 00:05:53.186
Distance, 18.3 kilometers.

00:05:53.478 --> 00:05:56.690
Dig deep!
Attack the same location again!

00:05:56.773 --> 00:05:58.441
Take this, you scum!

00:06:13.123 --> 00:06:14.624
It has stopped advancing.

00:06:14.708 --> 00:06:17.544
All right. Keep going
and make it change course.

00:06:23.466 --> 00:06:25.302
The enemy BRAI has opened.

00:06:26.511 --> 00:06:29.806
Quantum reaction detected
in the head of the BRAI!

00:06:30.181 --> 00:06:33.727
This BRAI contains it as well.

00:06:34.769 --> 00:06:37.606
Dark Chaos... The Dark Drive.

00:06:47.282 --> 00:06:48.241
What is this?

00:07:10.972 --> 00:07:11.973
Ultrasonic waves?

00:07:12.057 --> 00:07:13.183
Reboot it!

00:07:13.391 --> 00:07:15.644
It's not responding to my commands!

00:07:21.608 --> 00:07:23.818
No response from the helicopter team.

00:07:23.902 --> 00:07:27.781
It seems they have crashed.
Several ground vehicles immobilized, too!

00:07:36.247 --> 00:07:37.624
Don't underestimate us!

00:07:38.959 --> 00:07:41.086
-Check in with remaining forces!
-Yes, sir!

00:07:41.169 --> 00:07:43.546
-Tell those who can still move to attack!
-Got it!

00:07:44.547 --> 00:07:46.383
<i>I'm sending out Leon's MOEV!</i>

00:07:46.466 --> 00:07:49.886
Rejected! What will you do
if it goes out of control again?

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:52.055
If the absolute-defense system
is destroyed,

00:07:52.305 --> 00:07:54.516
it will be the end of Neo Xianglong!

00:07:55.016 --> 00:07:57.978
<i>Are you hoping to get it to leave</i>
<i>by throwing your shit at it?</i>

00:07:58.061 --> 00:07:58.895
Cain.

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:00.355
Oh, beg your pardon.

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.108
I can't stand his vulgarity either.

00:08:03.733 --> 00:08:06.277
<i>Mr. Scientist here wants to say something.</i>

00:08:06.695 --> 00:08:09.280
<i>-Right...</i>
-We'll use the Infinity Cannon.

00:08:14.995 --> 00:08:18.748
<i>The rumored "Ultimate Weapon"</i>
<i>that Neo Xianglong is so proud of?</i>

00:08:18.832 --> 00:08:19.833
<i>We can't use it.</i>

00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:21.001
What?

00:08:21.126 --> 00:08:25.171
<i>To use the Infinity Cannon, all the energy</i>
<i>in the city must be diverted to it.</i>

00:08:25.839 --> 00:08:29.467
<i>Doing that would waste</i>
<i>the food produced at the factories</i>

00:08:29.926 --> 00:08:31.678
<i>and harm patients in the hospitals.</i>

00:08:32.429 --> 00:08:35.265
The very existence
of Neo Xianglong is at stake!

00:08:35.473 --> 00:08:37.100
Sacrifices are unavoidable.

00:08:37.517 --> 00:08:41.312
<i>Is it not your responsibility</i>
<i>to protect this city?</i>

00:08:44.566 --> 00:08:49.237
<i>That BRAI is a whale that has gone through</i>
<i>adaptation and rapid evolution.</i>

00:08:49.571 --> 00:08:52.574
<i>A whale? That is some evolution.</i>

00:08:52.949 --> 00:08:56.369
I believe that the BRAI's attack
is an ultrasonic wave

00:08:56.578 --> 00:08:59.914
that has been strengthened
in the multidimensional field.

00:09:00.832 --> 00:09:02.667
<i>After studying its frequencies,</i>

00:09:03.334 --> 00:09:05.712
<i>I've come to believe it's echolocation.</i>

00:09:06.546 --> 00:09:11.634
<i>By emitting ultrasonic waves, it can</i>
<i>know the locations of objects around it.</i>

00:09:14.304 --> 00:09:15.805
So, its eye has devolved.

00:09:16.139 --> 00:09:19.434
Makes sense.
That's why the flares didn't work.

00:09:21.478 --> 00:09:25.690
<i>The melon in a whale's head</i>
<i>is where these waves are focused.</i>

00:09:26.232 --> 00:09:29.861
<i>This is the target.</i>
<i>Based on the quantum energy reactions,</i>

00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:33.073
<i>we're assuming</i>
<i>the Dark Drive is also there.</i>

00:09:33.156 --> 00:09:38.328
<i>But penetrating its armor with our bullets</i>
<i>won't be easy. What's your plan?</i>

00:09:39.454 --> 00:09:40.663
I have my MOEV.

00:09:41.956 --> 00:09:45.460
<i>It can combine energy</i>
<i>from multiple dimensions,</i>

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:47.921
<i>making it possible to break through--</i>

00:09:48.004 --> 00:09:49.130
Who would pilot it?

00:09:49.714 --> 00:09:53.760
Who would pilot a machine
that might take its pilot's life?

00:09:54.052 --> 00:09:54.886
<i>Me.</i>

00:09:57.013 --> 00:09:58.098
I'll pilot it.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:02.894
I'll pilot it.

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:04.187
Leon!

00:10:04.395 --> 00:10:06.481
So, that's his plan.

00:10:07.023 --> 00:10:10.276
In order to activate the hyperdrive,
a human is needed.

00:10:10.777 --> 00:10:14.239
This is most likely due to the
quantum fluctuations in the human body.

00:10:15.365 --> 00:10:18.952
And because of that,
ever since synching my mind with it,

00:10:19.577 --> 00:10:23.623
<i>the machine became unable</i>
<i>to respond to anyone else.</i>

00:10:24.082 --> 00:10:25.250
Only to you?

00:10:26.084 --> 00:10:30.797
<i>Just as you said, I am responsible for</i>
<i>allowing the reactor to go out of control.</i>

00:10:31.798 --> 00:10:35.927
<i>Because of the infinite possibilities,</i>
<i>I lost myself in research.</i>

00:10:36.469 --> 00:10:38.763
<i>But at some point,</i>
<i>I felt something wasn't right.</i>

00:10:39.222 --> 00:10:40.306
Something wasn't right?

00:10:40.557 --> 00:10:42.559
<i>I knew we shouldn't have opened the box.</i>

00:10:43.101 --> 00:10:45.895
<i>But, because I was unsure,</i>
<i>I contacted Cecile--</i>

00:10:45.979 --> 00:10:46.813
Princess.

00:10:47.272 --> 00:10:51.818
<i>I contacted the princess and that's when</i>
<i>the reactor went out of control,</i>

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:54.529
<i>resulting in the Xianglong Crisis.</i>

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:58.074
<i>I also sensed the danger.</i>

00:10:59.367 --> 00:11:01.578
<i>So you only invested</i>

00:11:01.953 --> 00:11:03.913
<i>in order to stop the research?</i>

00:11:04.831 --> 00:11:06.791
<i>This time, I want to protect us.</i>

00:11:07.542 --> 00:11:10.295
<i>If I lose control again,</i>

00:11:11.838 --> 00:11:13.882
kill me if you wish.

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:27.896
Here.

00:11:34.193 --> 00:11:37.363
You get hungry easily, so...

00:11:37.989 --> 00:11:38.823
Thanks.

00:11:40.909 --> 00:11:42.577
Family contract, Article 9.

00:11:43.369 --> 00:11:45.038
"Always say, 'See you later.'"

00:11:50.877 --> 00:11:54.923
Family contract, Article 8.
"Always say, 'I'll be back.'"

00:11:58.635 --> 00:11:59.510
I'll be back.

00:12:00.637 --> 00:12:01.638
See you later.

00:12:12.899 --> 00:12:15.693
We're not real siblings.

00:12:15.902 --> 00:12:17.946
-Oh?
-After the reactor incident,

00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:21.491
I was all alone and he said,
"Let's become siblings!"

00:12:22.992 --> 00:12:26.079
<i>At first,</i>
<i>I had no idea what he was talking about.</i>

00:12:26.621 --> 00:12:29.040
<i>I thought he might be crazy. But...</i>

00:12:33.252 --> 00:12:35.463
<i>Even if we can't become a real family,</i>

00:12:35.838 --> 00:12:39.133
we can through a contract.
A family by contract!

00:12:39.634 --> 00:12:42.261
If you end up not liking it,
you can break the contract.

00:12:43.012 --> 00:12:46.182
Leon isn't great at talking to people.

00:12:46.641 --> 00:12:49.435
That's why he made and fixed devices
while I sold them

00:12:50.144 --> 00:12:52.897
and took care of the money side.

00:12:53.272 --> 00:12:56.317
We somehow made it this far
by combining our strengths.

00:12:58.236 --> 00:12:59.362
What's wrong?

00:12:59.570 --> 00:13:00.697
Nothing.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:03.658
<i>Damn it! This Japanese pepper</i>
<i>is making my eyes water.</i>

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:10.164
Activating main system.

00:13:10.748 --> 00:13:13.418
Start voice control and AI assist.

00:13:14.002 --> 00:13:16.462
<i>Preparation complete.</i>
<i>Now awaiting orders.</i>

00:13:25.346 --> 00:13:27.098
<i>Damage to the Nanzan District's wall!</i>

00:13:27.265 --> 00:13:29.475
The final wall is taking damage!

00:13:29.642 --> 00:13:31.269
<i>No response from the helicopters!</i>

00:13:31.561 --> 00:13:34.772
The BRAI is only 4.5 kilometers
from the absolute-defense system!

00:13:36.399 --> 00:13:38.651
If we don't start charging
the Infinity Cannon,

00:13:38.735 --> 00:13:39.986
it won't be ready in time.

00:13:41.696 --> 00:13:43.448
Permission for Pandora to mobilize!

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:46.242
Pandora One. Pandora Two. Launch!

00:13:46.534 --> 00:13:47.869
APRIL 30TH 2038, 13:20

00:13:47.952 --> 00:13:50.872
<i>Launch gate, standby.</i>
<i>Launch gate, standby.</i>

00:13:51.789 --> 00:13:54.208
<i>Pandora One, catapult ascending.</i>

00:13:54.959 --> 00:13:58.379
Drive system, operational.
Quantum circuits, all set.

00:14:09.974 --> 00:14:11.517
A stroll through the sky, eh?

00:14:11.809 --> 00:14:13.978
Don't piss yourself, Mr. Scientist.

00:14:16.064 --> 00:14:19.817
Same goes for you, Doug!
Pandora One, ready for launch!

00:14:30.828 --> 00:14:32.955
What? They sent the braniac?!

00:14:47.345 --> 00:14:48.638
Touchdown successful!

00:14:50.890 --> 00:14:52.225
Confirming operation.

00:14:53.017 --> 00:14:55.019
I've set the frequency
of the acoustic rounds

00:14:55.103 --> 00:14:58.231
to the opposite of the BRAI's
ultrasonic waves to neutralize them.

00:14:59.357 --> 00:15:00.942
<i>Keep firing from the same angle</i>

00:15:01.025 --> 00:15:02.902
<i>as my attack on the enemy.</i>

00:15:03.694 --> 00:15:06.197
<i>This will create a tunnel</i>
<i>in which the ultrasonic waves</i>

00:15:06.280 --> 00:15:08.491
<i>have no effect, so I can get close.</i>

00:15:09.075 --> 00:15:11.035
What if my shot is off a by a little?

00:15:11.369 --> 00:15:14.497
<i>Even just a little, and the tunnel</i>
<i>would become less effective</i>

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:16.666
<i>and the waves would impact me</i>
<i>with full force.</i>

00:15:17.208 --> 00:15:20.628
<i>Not even my MOEV could withstand it.</i>

00:15:23.423 --> 00:15:27.301
<i>Your aim will make or break</i>
<i>this operation, Doug.</i>

00:15:28.261 --> 00:15:30.054
That's quite a big responsibility.

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:33.057
All units, cover Pandora One
and Pandora Two.

00:15:33.266 --> 00:15:36.102
That's reckless.
There's no way they can succeed!

00:15:40.106 --> 00:15:41.607
You bastard!

00:15:41.774 --> 00:15:44.485
There'll be big trouble
if you fail this time!

00:15:44.986 --> 00:15:47.405
Protect the outsiders!

00:15:52.869 --> 00:15:53.870
Here it comes.

00:16:03.588 --> 00:16:04.589
Yes!

00:16:08.426 --> 00:16:11.137
Adjusting course by 0.024.

00:16:19.854 --> 00:16:21.189
When this mission is over,

00:16:21.397 --> 00:16:22.815
<i>please take me for a drink!</i>

00:16:23.024 --> 00:16:25.693
It's bad luck to say that kind of thing.

00:16:31.407 --> 00:16:35.786
He's adjusting trajectory
for current wind direction and strength.

00:16:37.705 --> 00:16:40.124
Just who is this man?

00:16:45.004 --> 00:16:46.130
<i>From childhood,</i>

00:16:46.506 --> 00:16:49.175
<i>I received the education necessary</i>
<i>to maintain this city</i>

00:16:49.467 --> 00:16:52.762
<i>and studied with all my might. Even so...</i>

00:16:54.055 --> 00:16:58.142
<i>One day, you appeared</i>
<i>and surpassed me with ease.</i>

00:16:59.268 --> 00:17:03.940
<i>My place at the top that I had never</i>
<i>surrendered, the admiration of adults.</i>

00:17:04.482 --> 00:17:06.901
<i>In the blink of an eye,</i>
<i>you took it all from me.</i>

00:17:07.193 --> 00:17:09.403
<i>But you had no interest in that at all.</i>

00:17:10.488 --> 00:17:14.158
<i>And then, you skipped grades</i>
<i>and went to university.</i>

00:17:15.034 --> 00:17:16.786
<i>Time passed by.</i>

00:17:17.828 --> 00:17:18.955
Nice to meet you.

00:17:19.705 --> 00:17:20.957
I'm Leon Lau.

00:17:21.541 --> 00:17:23.543
<i>Have we met before?</i>

00:17:27.171 --> 00:17:30.675
Are you saying
I wasn't even worth remembering?

00:17:31.342 --> 00:17:35.179
Will you always be looking down on me?

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:39.058
P2, do you understand?
If P1 were to

00:17:39.141 --> 00:17:40.393
<i>lose control...</i>

00:17:40.935 --> 00:17:44.021
I'm not a big fan of shooting my target
in the back, but yes.

00:17:45.022 --> 00:17:48.359
<i>Don't make me kill you, Leon Lau.</i>

00:17:49.485 --> 00:17:50.778
Almost there!

00:17:53.864 --> 00:17:55.366
Terraroid Formation!

00:18:10.381 --> 00:18:11.966
Data link is functional.

00:18:12.049 --> 00:18:15.261
Multidimensional resonance spectrum,
Fibonacci expansion.

00:18:22.435 --> 00:18:24.645
Damn you!

00:18:25.771 --> 00:18:26.772
Leon!

00:18:31.277 --> 00:18:32.278
This is bad!

00:18:35.615 --> 00:18:37.992
Don't hold this against me, Mr. Scientist.

00:18:45.041 --> 00:18:49.086
Family contract, Article 73.

00:18:49.503 --> 00:18:52.423
"Wash dirty dishes before bed!"

00:18:53.341 --> 00:18:57.803
Family contract, Article 47.
"On sunny days, do the laundry!"

00:18:58.346 --> 00:18:59.347
Chloe...

00:19:08.564 --> 00:19:09.482
In that case...

00:19:16.155 --> 00:19:18.324
Family contract, Article 91.

00:19:19.158 --> 00:19:21.494
"Don't go to dangerous places alone!"

00:19:21.869 --> 00:19:24.330
Family contract, Article 108.

00:19:24.914 --> 00:19:26.290
"Don't you ever..."

00:19:26.749 --> 00:19:33.589
"Die alone!"

00:19:46.227 --> 00:19:48.771
-Yeah!
-He did it!

00:19:48.854 --> 00:19:50.481
I'm thirsty.

00:19:50.856 --> 00:19:53.109
Jay, bring me more tea.

00:19:53.192 --> 00:19:56.070
Yes. Right away, Princess.

00:19:58.614 --> 00:20:03.035
I don't get paid nearly enough for this.
Well, whatever.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.248
That guy...

00:20:16.006 --> 00:20:19.093
It's over... Chloe.

00:20:28.394 --> 00:20:29.228
I knew it...

00:20:30.312 --> 00:20:31.689
This hunger must be

00:20:31.772 --> 00:20:34.859
caused by my mind being synched
with the hyperdrive.

00:20:35.151 --> 00:20:40.072
Here you go! Leon's favorite,
hot pot with lamb!

00:20:40.489 --> 00:20:42.616
Nice work, Mr. Scientist.

00:20:44.785 --> 00:20:46.662
Huh? You're not going to eat?

00:20:47.037 --> 00:20:50.040
I'm going somewhere a little more mature.

00:20:50.416 --> 00:20:51.667
Mature?

00:20:53.419 --> 00:20:54.295
No!

00:20:55.129 --> 00:20:58.591
<i>Don't turn Leon into a sleaze, too!</i>

00:20:58.799 --> 00:21:00.176
<i>What do you mean "sleaze?"</i>

00:21:01.135 --> 00:21:03.345
How's your body holding up, Leon?

00:21:03.637 --> 00:21:07.892
<i>We'll find out... Oh, you're stiff!</i>

00:21:07.975 --> 00:21:10.227
<i>Ow! No, I'm fine.</i>

00:21:10.311 --> 00:21:11.979
<i>Doug, you're next!</i>

00:21:12.062 --> 00:21:12.938
<i>Forget it.</i>

00:21:13.022 --> 00:21:17.026
-Not interested in being touched by men.
-Don't be so shy!

00:21:18.235 --> 00:21:20.488
Damage to the city was kept to a minimum.

00:21:21.238 --> 00:21:22.114
No civilians died.

00:21:22.198 --> 00:21:23.032
XIANGLONG HOTPOT

00:21:24.033 --> 00:21:25.409
I see.

00:21:25.868 --> 00:21:26.786
That's all.

00:21:30.498 --> 00:21:33.083
Are you sure we haven't met somewhere?

00:21:33.959 --> 00:21:34.960
I think not.

00:21:38.547 --> 00:21:42.343
Secretary. Please transfer me to Pandora.

00:21:44.595 --> 00:21:45.888
Do as you wish.

00:21:45.971 --> 00:21:46.972
Yes, sir.

00:21:48.599 --> 00:21:52.978
Again? Come on, Leon.
You're getting sauce all over your shirt.

00:23:25.362 --> 00:23:29.950
Hyperdrive? How wonderful.
It sounds interesting.

00:23:30.451 --> 00:23:33.621
Our target is the Quantum Reactor
and Neo Xianglong.

00:23:34.204 --> 00:23:38.459
If you desire power,
do not forget that, Wang.

00:23:39.043 --> 00:23:43.255
It seems as though
we will be able to meet again...

00:23:44.214 --> 00:23:45.299
Queenie Yoh.

00:23:46.967 --> 00:23:50.387
THE ENEMY ABOVE

00:23:50.471 --> 00:23:51.930
Subtitle translation by Amanda Miller
